OL,3,GNEWSADoctors call for greater say in
OL,4,Aassisted dying law
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of doctors on the Isle of Man
OL,7,Fhave called for greater involvement in
OL,8,Fdeveloping safeguards for assisted
OL,9,Fdying after legislation received Royal
OL,10,FAssent.
OL,12,FThe Isle of Man Medical Society said
OL,13,Falmost three-quarters of its members
OL,14,Fopposed the practice - raising concerns
OL,15,Fabout the eligibility criteria, its
OL,16,Fimplementation and the potential for
OL,17,Fpatients to be coerced.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
