OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%,.*,$-, *.*  * %** %%* (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADoctors call for greater say in
OL,4,Aassisted dying law
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe law will allow adults who have
OL,7,Flived on the island for at least five
OL,8,Fyears, who have a terminal illness with
OL,9,Fa life expectancy of 12 months or less,
OL,10,Fto request an assisted death.
OL,12,FThe island becomes the second place in
OL,13,Fthe British Isles to make assisted
OL,14,Fdying law, after a similar bill in
OL,15,FJersey was given Royal Assent in July.
